================================================================================
1. Grok Build — GrokNight / GrokDay terminal themes
================================================================================

Madoe Night and Madoe Day carry over the neutral-grayscale structure
("background/foreground/gutter/comment" ramps) of the GrokNight and
GrokDay terminal themes shipped with Grok Build, xAI's open-source coding
agent CLI.

